8BHcS4CvAQ3IcHCHUoBA",null,null,null,[2],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["湯頭粉感很重，對來說不算特別扣分，但還是有點四不像的感覺，也沒什麼尾韻，聽說是豚骨和雞湯的結合，但吃起來不說完美調和，而是介在一個我也不知道怎麼形容的點。麵條我反而很喜歡，像是蕎麥麵的口感，很Q彈有嚼勁，讓我現在還想再吃。一大塊粉紅色的肉，剛上來的時候涼涼的，要泡在湯裡一陣子才會加溫。但這塊肉也真的很妙，單純用燙的感覺，沾上湯還是能入口，但第一口吃到有點冷的肉就覺得很解。菜的部分用了很多粗粗硬硬的部分，不太懂為什麼要放這種菜梗，整體來說整碗拉麵都很莫名其妙的感覺，以這樣的方式認識勝王屬實可惜，但也沒辦法了。",null,[0,256]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/146569058890200648/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPVkdKRVFsZE5lazB4VWtjNVRsRnJNWGhpVkZKSFdERTVXV014UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1785,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOVGJEQldNek0xUkc5TlFrMXhiVFJHWDE5WWMxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x71a680846c0caf7a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlNTbDBWMzM1RG9NQk1xbTRGX19Yc1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOVGJEQldNek0xUkc5TlFrMXhiVFJHWDE5WWMxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2x